00:14:30.953 --> 00:14:32.125
Aw, shit.
That's old news, Simon.


00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:35.045
Well, not to me, it ain't.


00:14:35.166 --> 00:14:36.759
I been drillin' steel
out in Montana


00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:38.503
