00:17:44.021 --> 00:17:45.773
Plenty of jobs,
just not for long.


00:17:45.898 --> 00:17:47.900
I even took a job
at that creamery,


00:17:48.025 --> 00:17:49.572
just to get her
a few extra things,


00:17:49.694 --> 00:17:51.196
and when I lost that,
she... uh...


00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.914
