inside all day.


00:17:54.031 --> 00:17:56.454
I was raised to farm.
It's all I know.


00:17:58.536 --> 00:18:02.291
How can I help you, John?


00:18:02.415 --> 00:18:04.417
She mentioned counselin', once.


00:18:04.542 --> 00:18:07.136
I'll go now,


00:18:07.253 --> 00:18:08.550
