comfortable with me?


00:18:49.629 --> 00:18:51.973
Simon says you're cheaper
than the rest of 'em in town.


00:18:52.089 --> 00:18:55.138
That mean you ain't as good?


00:18:55.259 --> 00:18:56.636
Well...


00:18:56.761 --> 00:18:58.479
