through thick and thin.


00:19:14.111 --> 00:19:15.784
How serious of scrapes
you got him out of?


00:19:15.905 --> 00:19:18.283
Well, that's between
him and me, John.


00:19:18.407 --> 00:19:21.627
Just as anything you tell me
