00:19:36.634 --> 00:19:38.887
Your, uh...


00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:41.855
Your poaching arrests...


00:19:41.972 --> 00:19:43.440
Is it three now?...


00:19:43.557 --> 00:19:44.604
